{"hookSpecificOutput":{"hookEventName":"PreToolUse","additionalContext":"Ops domain: VM lifecycle. Load the ops-vm skill now. Non-negotiable: a clone is not usable until UUID, every MAC, /etc/machine-id, SSH host keys and the cloud-init instance-id are regenerated (virt-sysprep does all five); snapshot before risky changes; never boot a clone on the same L2 as its source before the MAC is changed."}}